{"ref":"BDB, כְּהֻנָּה","hw":"כְּהֻנָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כְּהֻנָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. priesthood</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:9\" href=\"/Exodus.29.9\">Ex 29:9</a> + 5 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּהֻנַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:13\" href=\"/Numbers.25.13\">Nu 25:13</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּהֻנַּתְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:1\" href=\"/Numbers.18.1\">Nu 18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:7\" href=\"/Numbers.18.7\">7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּהֻנָּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:10\" href=\"/Numbers.3.10\">Nu 3:10</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּהֻנּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.36\">1 S 2:36</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">כהנת יהוה</span> <em>priesthood of</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, the portion of the Levites <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:7\" href=\"/Joshua.18.7\">Jos 18:7</a> (D); pl. <em>priest’s offices</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.36\">1 S 2:36</a>; elsewhere <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:9\" href=\"/Exodus.29.9\">Ex 29:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:15\" href=\"/Exodus.40.15\">40:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:10\" href=\"/Numbers.3.10\">Nu 3:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:10\" href=\"/Numbers.16.10\">16:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:1\" href=\"/Numbers.18.1\">18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:7\" href=\"/Numbers.18.7\">7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:13\" href=\"/Numbers.25.13\">25:13</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:62\" href=\"/Ezra.2.62\">Ezr 2:62</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:63\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.63\">Ne 7:64</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.29\">Ne 13:29</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.","next":"BDB, כּוּב","prev":"BDB, כָּהַן"}